# Bryce Lab parameter files (frcmod / lib / mol2) - fetched on the server
# via scripts/fetch_amber_cofactors.sh. Not bundled into the repo because
# licensing / hosting is on the Manchester side; the fetch script is the
# single source of truth + provenance.
*.frcmod
*.lib
*.mol2
*.prep
*.off
*.amberparm
# but keep the docs/manifest committed
!README.md
!.gitignore
!MANIFEST.yaml
